ifntransform 1

file_soil_npool "soil_npool.out"
file_soil_nflux "soil_nflux.out"

frac_labile_carbon 	0.6	! Microbial pools: SURFMICRO, SOILMICRO
frac_labile_carbon_humus 0.2	! Humified pools: SURFHUMUS, SLOWSOM, PASSIVESOM
! The two shares of a pool's decomposition that modules/somdynam.cpp recycles
! into the labile carbon ntransform.cpp denitrifies on. Li, Frolking and
! Frolking (1992), the DNDC paper Xu-Ri and Prentice (2008) take Kc from, p.
! 9765: soluble carbon "consists of the carbon from microbial biomass
! decomposition (60%) and humads decomposition (20%) that is recycled into
! microbial biomass". Those are the two numbers, read as fractions of
! decomposition; the litter pools contribute nothing, which is DNDC's residues
! reaching soluble carbon only after passing through microbial biomass.
!
! DECLARED DIVERGENCE FROM MAINLINE: labile_carbon_microbial_share, owner
! world-vyvn. Stock LPJ-GUESS 4.1.1 and the vendored CNP fork both set
!     frac_labile_carbon 0.5
! and both apply it to the summed respiration of every pool. 0.5 is the humads
! path's soluble-to-respired ratio 0.2/0.4 exactly, so mainline runs one of two
! path coefficients on both paths. frac_labile_carbon_humus has no mainline
! counterpart: the second key exists because the form does. The split itself is
! registered as labile_carbon_paths in biosphere/config/somdynam.yaml.

k_N 			0.083
k_C 			0.017

f_denitri_max 		0.33	! Maximum amount of NO3 conv. to NO2
f_denitri_gas_max 	0.33	! Maximum gaseus losses in denitrification
f_nitri_max 		0.1	! Maximum amount of NH4 nitrified
f_nitri_gas_max 	0.022	! Maximum gaseus losses in nitrification
! RNON + RN2ON, table 11 of Xu-Ri and Prentice (2008), applied by table 8
! eqns 3 and 4. RNON, the rate of NO production from nitrification, is
! 0.1-4 per cent with a stated mean of 2 per cent; RN2ON, the rate of N2O
! production from nitrification, is under 0.1-0.2 per cent with no mean
! stated, so the top of the bound is taken. The sum brackets at 0.2-4.2
! per cent. The port ran at 0.33, which is 7.9 times the top of that
! bracket and 15 times its mean.
!
! DECLARED DIVERGENCE FROM MAINLINE: nitrification_gas_share, owner world-i2ch.
! Stock LPJ-GUESS 4.1.1 sets
!     f_nitri_gas_max 0.25
! and reads it in denitrification, not in nitrification; the crossed reads are
! recorded in modules/ntransform.cpp beside each of them. Uncrossed, this
! constant is the nitrification gas share and 0.25 is still 6 times the top of
! the bracket above. f_denitri_max, f_denitri_gas_max, f_nitri_max, k_N and k_C
! are all at their mainline values.
